4
00:00:07,088 --> 00:00:08,320
from the very beginning.

5
00:00:08,448 --> 00:00:11,600
This week's portion is called Bereshit, which means

6
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,760
"In the Beginning," and it is the opening

7
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:18,249
chapter of the entire Five Books of Moses.Here

8
00:00:18,276 --> 00:00:20,809
is our summary of Genesis, chapter one, verse

9
00:00:20,869 --> 00:00:23,289
one, through chapter six, verse eight.

10
00:00:23,469 --> 00:00:26,249
The portion opens with God creating the world

11
00:00:26,276 --> 00:00:28,569
in six days — calling forth light from

12
00:00:28,631 --> 00:00:31,929
darkness, separating sky from sea, filling the earth

13
00:00:31,977 --> 00:00:35,769
with plants, animals, and finally humankind, made in

14
00:00:35,789 --> 00:00:36,809
the divine image.

15
00:00:37,022 --> 00:00:40,089
On the seventh day, God rests and declares

16
00:00:40,121 --> 00:00:41,129
that day holy.

17
00:00:41,289 --> 00:00:43,929
Then we zoom in closer, to a garden

18
00:00:43,975 --> 00:00:46,569
called Eden, where God forms the first human

19
00:00:46,617 --> 00:00:48,569
from the dust of the earth and breathes

20
00:00:48,649 --> 00:00:50,089
life into his nostrils.

21
00:00:50,229 --> 00:00:52,729
God plants two special trees in the garden

22
00:00:52,889 --> 00:00:54,569
— the tree of life and the tree

23
00:00:54,596 --> 00:00:56,489
of knowledge of good and bad — and

24
00:00:56,542 --> 00:00:59,209
gives one command: do not eat from the

25
00:00:59,273 --> 00:01:00,249
tree of knowledge.

26
00:01:00,429 --> 00:01:02,889
God then creates a woman as a partner,

27
00:01:02,929 --> 00:01:05,049
and for a moment everything is whole and

28
00:01:05,102 --> 00:01:05,609
innocent.

29
00:01:05,749 --> 00:01:09,209
But the serpent, the shrewdest of creatures, convinces

30
00:01:09,229 --> 00:01:11,449
the woman that eating the forbidden fruit will

31
00:01:11,513 --> 00:01:14,089
open their eyes, and she eats and shares

32
00:01:14,116 --> 00:01:15,049
it with her husband.

33
00:01:15,142 --> 00:01:18,809
Immediately their innocence is shattered — they realize

34
00:01:18,841 --> 00:01:21,289
they are naked, they hide from God, and

35
00:01:21,321 --> 00:01:23,609
when confronted, they each point the finger at

36
00:01:23,649 --> 00:01:24,409
someone else.

37
00:01:24,589 --> 00:01:27,769
God pronounces consequences on all three — the

38
00:01:27,829 --> 00:01:30,329
