39
00:01:30,386 --> 00:01:32,329
drives them out of the garden forever.

40
00:01:32,469 --> 00:01:36,409
Outside Eden, the first family begins, and tragedy

41
00:01:36,459 --> 00:01:40,649
follows quickly: Cain, consumed by jealousy, murders his

42
00:01:40,689 --> 00:01:43,049
brother Abel and is condemned to wander the

43
00:01:43,102 --> 00:01:43,449
