44
00:01:43,629 --> 00:01:46,729
The portion then traces the generations from Adam

45
00:01:46,749 --> 00:01:48,889
through his son Seth all the way down

46
00:01:48,942 --> 00:01:51,769
to a man named Noah, cataloging lives that

47
00:01:51,809 --> 00:01:54,329
stretch across hundreds of years — and yet

48
00:01:54,377 --> 00:01:57,209
each entry ends with the same quiet words:

49
00:01:57,489 --> 00:02:00,889
"then he died." By the end, humanity has

50
