52
00:02:06,109 --> 00:02:10,980
man, Noah, finds favor in God's eyes.Thank you

53
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:13,460
so much for listening to Parashah in Brief

54
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:15,700
